  "description": "Compile-time dependency injection lifetime analyzer for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection: Roslyn diagnostics for captive dependencies, DI scope leaks, BuildServiceProvider misuse, service locator usage, circular dependencies, and unresolvable services in ASP.NET Core and .NET apps—before runtime.",
